### Health
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### Context-sensitive initials prediction
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input_mode": "initials",
  "bci_input": "ㄷㅇㅈ",
  "partner": "friend",
  "situation": "schedule",
  "recent_context": ["다음 주에 약속 잡을까"],
  "context_level": "full",
  "top_k": 3
}

### EEG top-k fusion
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/predict
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "input_mode": "initials",
  "bci_input": "ㄷㅇㅈ",
  "partner": "family",
  "situation": "positioning",
  "recent_context": ["혼자 자세를 바꾸기 어렵다"],
  "eeg_score_type": "probability",
  "eeg_hypotheses": [
    {"initials": "ㄷㅇㅈ", "score": 0.61},
    {"initials": "ㄷㅇㅊ", "score": 0.22},
    {"initials": "ㅌㅇㅈ", "score": 0.17}
  ],
  "top_k": 3
}
